    <Prose>The four measurements, the two-bell model, the covariance gallery and the two-mode conditional process are constructed fixtures with declared parameters. The Iris results are calculations on the identified real dataset under one fixed split, one declared selection rule and one reserved test. None of them is a benchmark, a species probability or a claim about any future dataset.</Prose>
